                <mxCell id="n1" value="• Step 6 returns 202 before ETL runs. The client never blocks on Qwen. Poll step 16 for triples_count.&#10;• Step 9 picks a LangChain loader (PyPDF / Text / Unstructured* / VideoFileLoader). No regex extraction.&#10;• Step 11 always uses the base model on :8003. Fine-tune adapters are not loaded here.&#10;• 4xx on task.response is terminal. 5xx re-publishes file.uploaded until max_retries, then DLQ.&#10;• JSONL path is data/triples/{user_id}/{correlation_id}.jsonl — user B cannot read user A." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
